<title>USA: Ault, Shinko Shoji form alliance.</title>
<headline>Ault, Shinko Shoji form alliance.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ault Inc on Wednesday said that Shinko Shoji Co Ltd of Japan agreed to distribute Ault's line of external power-conversion products in Asia.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed in Ault's statement.</p>
<p>Frederick Green, Ault's president, said the alliance would help the company attain its goal of gaining wider access to the Pacific Rim electronics market.</p>
<p>Ault supplies manufacturers of telecommunications, data communications, computer peripherals and medical equipment.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
